      "prompt": [
        {
          "type": "markdown",
          "text": "The function $f$ is defined by $f ( x )=7 x 3$ . In the $xy$-plane, the graph of $y=g ( x )$\n= $7 x 3+2$ is the result of shifting the graph of $y=f ( x )$ down 2 units. Which\nequation defines function $g$？"
        }
